---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Supernetter from '../components/Supernetter.astro';
import NavBar from '../components/NavBar.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="CIDR Supernetting Calculator – Route Summarization Tool | DevSubnet"
  description="Free online CIDR supernetting / route summarization calculator. Combine contiguous networks into a single summary route to reduce routing table size and improve convergence."
>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <NavBar path="supernet" />
    <main>
      <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="eyebrow">SUPERNETTING / ROUTE SUMMARIZATION</div>
        <h1 id="page-title">CIDR Supernetting Calculator</h1>
        <p class="lede">Combine multiple contiguous networks into a single summary route — reducing routing table size, lowering router memory use, and accelerating route convergence.</p>
      </section>
      <section aria-label="Supernetting workspace">
        <Supernetter />
      </section>
      <section class="guide-section">
        <div class="guide-sticky"><h2>What is <em>supernetting</em>?</h2></div>
        <div class="guide-content">
          <div class="guide-block">
            <h3>From many networks to one summary route</h3>
            <p>Supernetting (also called CIDR aggregation or route summarization) combines several contiguous smaller networks into a single larger prefix. For example, 192.168.0.0/24 through 192.168.3.0/24 collapse into a single 192.168.0.0/22 summary route.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="guide-block">
            <h3>Why summarize routes?</h3>
            <p>Fewer routes mean smaller routing tables, reduced memory and CPU on routers, faster convergence when the topology changes, and fewer updates propagated across the network. This is why supernetting is a core best practice in enterprise routing designs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <span>DEVSUBNET.COM / ENGINEERED FOR CLEAR NETWORKS</span>
      <div class="footer-links"><a href="/about">About Us</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/faq">FAQ</a></div>
      <span>NO DATA LEAVES YOUR DEVICE</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>
